@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = replace-with-login-token

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Seed admin login
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"Admin@123"}

### Authenticated resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/crops
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

